{"id":"980f251a44c0f948","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-cor-measurable.md","title":"Measurable Corollary","display":"cor-measurable — Measurable Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-measurable","aliases":["58-cor-measurable"],"display":"cor-measurable — Measurable Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-measurable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-measurable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-measurable — Measurable Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md\">../batch10/58-df-measurable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> (measurable-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md\">../batch10/58-df-measurable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationary-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}measurable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Stationary}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}measurable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Stationary}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every measurable cardinal is strongly inaccessible and Mahlo.</li>\n<li>In particular, the regular cardinals below it form a stationary set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}$ (measurable-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stationary}$ (stationary-subset predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}measurable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Stationary}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1019,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-cor-measurable.md|58-cor-measurable]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["109d01fe15884218","0fbfc19800246e77","b802c3dd76418d95"]}